evals.prompt:
Review this component's CSS and fix what's wrong with the animations and interactions. Return the corrected CSS with a short note per change:

.promo-card {
  border-left: 6px solid #7c3aed;
  transition: all 0.3s ease-in;
}
.promo-card:hover { width: 320px; padding: 28px; }
.promo-card__title {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7c3aed, #ec4899);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}
.promo-card--enter {
  animation: cardIn 400ms ease-in;
}
@keyframes cardIn {
  from { transform: scale(0); opacity: 0; }
  to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
}
